> the posterior of your model was actually different just because of your prior on sigma(unif(0,20)). I made some new
> plots :)
> Both pairs differs just with prior on sigma, either uniform(0,20) or invGamma(.001,.001). Both trials are using 4
> chains, each 10k iterations - 2k for warmup. I specified initials only for WinBUGS.
> Seems like Stan doesn't handle gamma distribution well. And your model seems to fit better.
>

> <https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-CP1L271Q-HY/Ui27vIJiG-I/AAAAAAAAAKc/lUigBO8KKFo/s1600/gamma_unif1.jpeg>
>
>
