In practice, plot() does something similar to the proposal above, since
parameters with many values only have the results for the first ones that
fit on the page.

I suspect that plot is rendering the entire graph behind the scenes,
since it takes quite awhile for the graph to appear.  There might be a
way to optimize it.

Ross

>
> Fancier versions could allow a list of indices, with the list names
> matching parameter names.
>
> It's not clear to me such functionality belongs in the package...

