Yes, you can do that, but for now, it requires recompiling
Stan (that is, we don't have a plugin architecture going yet,
but we're thinking about it).

Basically, you can define functions the same way the functions
in stan/agrad/rev are coded up.  They need to support auto-diff
if they have inputs that are parameters.  This can be as easy
as just supplying template inputs.

