> sampler gets too far into the tail of the posterior. Does this sound possible?

Yes.  Have you tried initializing with something more
reasonable.  We have an init=0 option that will set all
the init values to 0 in the unconstrained space (simplexes
are uniform, positive-constrained variables initialized to 1,
unbounded parameters initialized to 0, bounded parameters
initialized to middle of the bound).

- Bob

