>
> Plot is also slow (I don't know if there's a way to
> make it faster --- it just seems to me that R plotting is pretty
> slow).

I speculate that plot plots everything, even if it's off in space to
the right of the visible area.  If that's so, it's a lot of wasted
effort.  For example, I have 47x5 beta parameters, but only about 7x5
fit on the screen.

