That's really odd because there's nothing deeply
recursive in Stan.

A quick search on the web seems like it may be related to
R running out of memory.

What can happen if the model's complicated is that you'll
need more memory for certain iterations than others if
more leapfrog steps are necessary.

> The segfault comes after running for approx 15 min.  I'm running OSX 10.8.5.

Can you run fewer iterations and get it to complete?

